{"3365680": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "NONEWORLD", "steam_appid": 3365680, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4884530], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365680/extras/44f42d008d1a579945192970dcd220a3.avif?t=1784727995\" width=800 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>NONEWORLD</strong> is a turn-based RPG adventure set in a strange dying universe. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As a Princess from another world, you awaken in a forgotten castle. Your past now only a fading memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Join forces with fruity colored allies, fight horrifying foes and destroy<i> a lot </i>of farmland in your journey to return home. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365680/extras/3b2391ab40648fa0afea11e13097d777.avif?t=1784727995\" width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Dive into a strange hand-drawn world with an intriguing narrative. Interact with the environment to discover new information to document in the <i>Tome of Knowledge</i>.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365680/extras/46862d6ee627e89ba00884025af0b483.avif?t=1784727995\" width=800 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Experience three immersive story chapters packed with unique gameplay systems and characters; each chapter requires roughly an hour or more to complete.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365680/extras/cb0d719dabbe3451b26b9ccea8d13b69.avif?t=1784727995\" width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Fight alongside <i>Mayday</i>, <i>Cloud</i> and <i>Ophelia</i> in your journey to return home. Each with a distinct, lovable personality with an important connection to the Princess.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365680/extras/a78b022e6a17d2a4e0531b2c72d26480.avif?t=1784727995\" width=800 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Master a unique turn-based battle system. Carefully manage your party resources to combine <i>Energy</i> and </strong><strong><i>Revenge</i></strong><strong> abilities to slay a roster of manifestations. </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365680/extras/be419b5f426736d52596983485992296.avif?t=1784727995\" width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Explore diverse environments, complete side quests and gather items to forge powerful gear sets. Leave no stone unturned to find the coveted <i>Shadow Weapon</i>.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365680/extras/f46d301a36c760c30624671134aac111.avif?t=1784727995\" width=800 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Play through the story on several difficulty options, including Irregularis: where saving is disabled and checkpoints are disabled. Once you die, </strong><strong><i>that's it</i></strong><strong>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365680/extras/5b2362b1a4d4bca97d4987305985062b.avif?t=1784727995\" width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Hunt down rare and hidden story Achievements with an always-offline progress system.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>...What's not to love?</i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365680/extras/e46498f37cbc55f3d0f42f7510d374e8.avif?t=1784727995\" width=800 height=260 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365680/extras/44f42d008d1a579945192970dcd220a3.avif?t=1784727995\" width=800 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>NONEWORLD</strong> is a turn-based RPG adventure set in a strange dying universe. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As a Princess from another world, you awaken in a forgotten castle. Your past now only a fading memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Join forces with fruity colored allies, fight horrifying foes and destroy<i> a lot </i>of farmland in your journey to return home. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365680/extras/3b2391ab40648fa0afea11e13097d777.avif?t=1784727995\" width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Dive into a strange hand-drawn world with an intriguing narrative. Interact with the environment to discover new information to docu